---
import Terminal from '../layouts/Terminal.astro';
import portrait from '../assets/portrait.png';
const record = [
    ['NAME', 'Elijah (Eli) Roussos'],
    ['LOCATION', 'New York, NY <-> Cape Town, ZA'],
    ['EDUCATION', 'MEng ECE, Cornell · BSc (Hons) CS, UCT'],
];
---
<Terminal title="About" section="about">
    <h1>ABOUT</h1>
    <section class="personnel" aria-label="Personnel record">
        <figure class="portrait">
            <img src={portrait.src} width={portrait.width} height={portrait.height}
                alt="Eli Roussos, rendered in green terminal pixels" />
            <figcaption>IMG-0001 · ROUSSOS, E.</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <div class="personnel-body">
            <dl class="personnel-record">
                {record.map(([field, value]) => <div><dt>{field}</dt><dd>{value}</dd></div>)}
            </dl>
            <div class="prose">
        <p>I'm Eli.</p>
        <p>
            I am a <a href="/resume/">software engineer</a> by trade, and while I love programming, distributed systems, and <a href="/papers/">machine learning</a>, I have a passion for music, video games, and sports.
        </p>
        <p>
            I play guitar (above averagely) and produce music in FL Studio (averagely). Some of my favourite artists are the Gorillaz, The Ink Spots, King Gizzard, and Tool.
            I also take photos, which go on Instagram as <a href="https://www.instagram.com/eli_takes_photos/">@eli_takes_photos</a> and on the <a href="/instagram/">Photos screen</a>.
        </p>
        <p>
            I love a variety of games, from Pokémon ROM Hacks on my little handheld emulator to Baldur's Gate 3, Fallout (obviously), Hollow Knight, Dota, & recently, Deadlock!
            Looking to play The Witcher 3, Elden Ring, and WoW: Forever (and let's be honest, probably more Deadlock).
        </p>
        <p>
            Love Padel and Tennis, if wanna hit up a game to play let me know! An obligatory 🧡LET'S GO KNICKS💙 and 💚LET'S GO BOKKE💛! Don't catch me missing those games.
        </p>
        <p>
            If I am not doing any of these things, I am probably coding/swarming my agents. Check out some of my <a href="/projects/">Projects</a>! Particularly
            interesting are <a href="/projects/surfsk8s/">surfsk8s</a>, <a href="/projects/agent-kit/">agent-kit</a>, <a href="/projects/pedalboi/">PedalBoi</a>, and <a href="/projects/icloud-photos-cli/">icloud-photos-cli</a>.
            I am a Zig/Elixir/Go/Rust fanboy, but mostly concerned with picking the right tool for the job! Stacks are a means to an end.
        </p>
        <p>
            Feel free to reach out on socials! Links are at the bottom.
        </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</Terminal>
